WEBVTT

00:16:58.273 --> 00:17:02.866
I brought my wife with me, actually,
to make sure I could get through this.

00:17:04.446 --> 00:17:05.614
My children

00:17:07.020 --> 00:17:08.182
came back

00:17:09.191 --> 00:17:10.343
to live with us.

00:17:10.367 --> 00:17:12.411
We had two more children after that.

00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:14.963
Resuscitated the career,

00:17:15.996 --> 00:17:18.520
even better than it had been before.

00:17:18.544 --> 00:17:20.973
Went right back into the university

00:17:22.404 --> 00:17:24.163
and began to write books.

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:26.172
Well, you know,

00:17:26.971 --> 00:17:28.309
it's been a wonderful life.

00:17:28.333 --> 00:17:31.509
It's been, as I said, close to 30 years.